{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35146","headline":"诗品二十四则 冲淡 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 冲淡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素处以默，妙机其微。\n饮之太和，独鹤与飞。\n犹之惠风，苒苒在衣。\n阅音修篁，美曰载归。\n遇之匪深，即之愈稀。\n脱有形似，握手已违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}